- [x] **Implement LocalStorage Cache** in [card_details.php](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/pokemon/application/views/pokemon/card_details.php) to save prices across page loads for 24 hours.
- [x] Map the precise TCGDex `pricing` data structure (e.g. `reverse-holofoil`) to the UI badge system.

